        {
          "path": "_m/9/y/j/u/hot-springs-arkansas-wp/an-american-spa-37512276174.jpg",
          "filename": "An American Spa (37512276174).jpg",
          "caption": "Bathhouse Row is the historic heart of an American spa.  Since the 1830s the city of Hot Springs has channeled much of its energy into becoming a national health resort.  The Federal government made \"taking the waters\" available to all by providing baths and health services to veterans and the poor, and the National Park landscaped many of the eercise paths that were considered essential to good health.\n\nSome of the bathhouse have closed locally, demand for medicinal baths peaked in 1946 - but it still discover the spa experience.  Traditional bathing remains available at the Buckstaff Bathhouse and some nearby hotels.  \n\nBathhouse Row @ Hot Springs National Park, Arkansas",
          "alt": "Bathhouse Row is the historic heart of an American spa.  Since the 1830s the city of Hot Springs has channeled much of its energy into becoming a national health resort.  The Federal government made \"taking the waters\" available to all by providing baths and health services to veterans and the poor, and the National Park landscaped many of the eercise paths that were considered essential to good health.\n\nSome of the bathhouse have closed locally, demand for medicinal baths peaked in 1946 - but it still discover the spa experience.  Traditional bathing remains available at the Buckstaff Bathhouse and some nearby hotels.  \n\nBathhouse Row @ Hot Springs National Park, Arkansas",
